      {
        "name": "纸页曲面",
        "value": "film/book.js:setLeaf：NS=40，th=π/2*u，L=.55*sin(πu)，逐段积分cos(phi)/sin(phi)；leafFront=旧ground，leafBack=下一skyLeaf或sky。"
